        `,-1)])]),_:1})),s[5]||(s[5]=e('<p>三层各自的约束：</p> <ul><li><strong>存储 API 层</strong>与 ROS2 解耦，只读写抽象的二进制消息与键值元数据，不感知消息类型；每个主题只能有一种编码方式，不支持同一主题混合编码</li> <li><strong>rosbag API 层</strong>负责把 ROS2 消息序列化后交给存储层，并支持任意编码格式的双向转换；录制时不指定 <code>--encoding</code>，则消息以中间件传来的二进制格式直接落盘，不做二次序列化</li> <li><strong>命令行层</strong>只是薄入口，逻辑都在 API 层</li></ul> <p>设计目标里值得注意的两条：回放必须是确定的（顺序播放 n 次收到相同的消息序列，靠录制时正确标记每条消息的时间戳保证）；长期存储要能应对消息定义的变化（新增字段的迁移需要反序列化，不能在高效回放序列化数据的同时完成）。</p> <h2 id="现行五层架构" tabindex="-1">现行五层架构 <a class="header-anchor" href="#现行五层架构" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;现行五层架构&quot;">​</a></h2> <p>现行代码（rolling）的实际分层：</p> ',10)),(i(),t(p,null,{default:a(()=>[n(r,{id:"mermaid-113",class:"mermaid",graph:"flowchart%20TD%0A%20%20%20%20USER%5B%22User%20Layer%EF%BC%9Aros2%20bag%20CLI%EF%BC%88ros2bag%EF%BC%89%3Cbr%2F%3EROS2%20Launch%20Files%22%5D%0A%20%20%20%20PY%5B%22Python%20Bindings%EF%BC%9Arosbag2_py%3Cbr%2F%3E%EF%BC%88pybind11%20%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%EF%BC%89%22%5D%0A%20%20%20%20TRANS%5B%22Transport%20Layer%EF%BC%9Arosbag2_transport%3Cbr%2F%3EPlayer%20%2F%20Recorder%EF%BC%88rclcpp%20%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%89%22%5D%0A%20%20%20%20CORE%5B%22Core%20C%2B%2B%EF%BC%9Arosbag2_cpp%20%2B%20rosbag2_compression%3Cbr%2F%3E%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%20I%2FO%E3%80%81%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%E3%80%81%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%22%5D%0A%20%20%20%20ABS%5B%22Storage%20Abstraction%EF%BC%9Arosbag2_storage%3Cbr%2F%3E%E5%8F%AF%E6%8F%92%E6%8B%94%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%22%5D%0A%20%20%20%20PLUGINS%5B%22Plugins%EF%BC%9Arosbag2_storage_mcap%EF%BC%88%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%89%3Cbr%2F%3Erosbag2_storage_sqlite3%E3%80%81zstd%20%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%E7%AD%89%22%5D%0A%20%20%20%20USER%20--%3E%20PY%20--%3E%20TRANS%20--%3E%20CORE%20--%3E%20ABS%20--%3E%20PLUGINS%0A"})]),fallback:a(()=>[...s[2]||(s[2]=[l(`
